    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so something weird happened earlier. like an hour ago my vision just went super blurry in my left eye for maybe 2 mins then it cleared up. and my right hand felt all clumsy and weird for a bit too but i feel totally fine now. should i be worried or just wait and see if it happens again?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
