      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That sudden blurriness and hand clumsiness are classic signs of a transient ischemic attack (TIA), which is a major warning sign of a stroke. You should NOT wait and see; you need to go to the emergency room immediately to get a CT scan and blood work while the symptoms are still fresh. Ignoring this could lead to a full-blown stroke within hours, so please head to the ER right now.",
